
### `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Environment variables
.env
.env.*

# IDEs and editors
.vscode/
.idea/

# Logs
*.log

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Python packaging
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/

# Demo database 
expenses.db